codex
The recovery scripts have no cross-session handoff check, so they can launch the A100 job while the L4 still targets the same checkpoint repo. The watchdog also treats failed jobs as ready to stop without checking hub uploads. I’m testing those paths with stubs and checking whether the gate’s identity checks accept the real seed-30 runs.

